{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of an adorable dungeon keeper in <strong>One Room Dungeon</strong>, where roguelike team-building meets strategic inventory management. Your tiny one-room dungeon is your fortress\u2014masterfully arrange your minions, whimsical relics, and delightful items to fend off pesky adventurers looking to raid your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065810/extras/Battle.gif?t=1744180047\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grid-Based Inventory Management</strong><br>Organize your dungeon with care using a grid-based system. Every item has its place, and your success depends on clever planning and tidy arrangements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065810/extras/Expand1.gif?t=1744180047\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Up Units and Items</strong><br>Strengthen your minions and magical artifacts over time. A well-trained team and upgraded gear are key to surviving tougher waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ultimate Skills</strong><br>Each unit has a unique Ultimate skill that activates when certain conditions are met\u2014turning the tide of battle in a flash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065810/extras/Ultimate.gif?t=1744180047\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Encounters</strong><br>Meet quirky friends and shopkeepers who may offer you rare items, game-changing gear, or curious relics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065810/extras/Encounter2.gif?t=1744180047\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relics, Equipment, and Potions</strong><br>Find and combine different enhancements to build powerful synergies and create new tactics in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Bosses</strong><br>Put your strategy and strength to the test against mighty bosses that require more than just brute force to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Starter Characters and Builds</strong><br>Choose from a range of starter characters, each with their own playstyle and skills. Pair them with starter relics to shape your run in entirely different ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect your dungeon (your home), <strong>defeat the adventurers</strong>, and prove yourself as the ultimate dungeon keeper in <strong>One Room Dungeon</strong>!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3065810/c03bbf19f0b10589fee05139559dd9391d89996a.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3065810/96bc890f2d87614fd6e752e5480ea236085e59ca.jpg"},{"name":"Very bad eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3065810/72fbb76925e8d1363f2b9f8cda4956d071474990.jpg"},{"name":"Big Tori","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3065810/0f78cb71d700305d1eb687540e12aaa92926ce79.jpg"},{"name":"Neo katz","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3065810/fbd6938efd57fa1d489493b87822cea01ed90c22.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon canon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3065810/a78abd59725086501c4bedfecbaef8d82a34d904.jpg"},{"name":"Egg Chicky ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3065810/23ccabf3b0dff543236d3a82d6c473fd17e6db94.jpg"},{"name":"Heart up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam