 item has its place, and your success depends on clever planning and tidy arrangements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065810/extras/Expand1.gif?t=1744180047\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Up Units and Items</strong><br>Strengthen your minions and magical artifacts over time. A well-trained team and upgraded gear are key to surviving tougher waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ultimate Skills</strong><br>Each unit has a unique Ultimate skill that activates when certain conditions are met\u2014turning the tide of battle in a flash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065810/extras/Ultimate.gif?t=1744180047\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Encounters</strong><br>Meet quirky friends and shopkeepers who may offer you rare items, game-changing gear, or curious relics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065810/extras/Encounter2.gif?t=1744180047\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relics, Equipment, and Potions</strong><br>Find and combine different enhancements to build powerful synergies and create new tactics in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Bosses</strong><br>Put your strategy and strength to the test against mighty bosses that require more than just brute force to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Starter Characters and Builds</strong><br>Choose from a range of starter characters, each with their own playstyle and skills. Pair them with starter relics to shape your run in entirely different ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect your dungeon (your home), <strong>defeat the adventurers</strong>, and prove yourself as